        "question_dQmYpg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What kind of dyes are used?",
            "content": "<p>Our fabrics are GOTS certified organic. <strong>Our white fabrics are exclusively whitened using oxygen and are free from bleach and harmful chemicals. </strong><em>All colors use natural, plant-based dyes.</em></p><p>We only use natural dyes - made from plants, flowers, fruits, vegetables and/or minerals. All of our dyes are GOTS (Global Organic Textile Standard) certified organic, NODS (Natural Organic Dye Standard) and all-natural. Everything we use is non-toxic, biodegradable, low impact, contain zero heavy metals, no insects and produces zero waste water.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_hbFgft": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What materials are your products made from?",
            "content": "<p>Heavenly Essentials pieces are made from <strong>100% GOTS certified Organic Linen fabric, </strong>100% organic linen sewing thread and natural tree rubber elastics (70% linen, 30% tree rubber). 0 synthetics.</p><p>Our products are made from high-quality and premium European flax linen materials, designed for maximum comfort and durability. We prioritize softness, breathability, and long-lasting wear in all our undergarments.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#545454"
          }
        },
        "question_3GiRD3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Where are Heavenly Essentials materials sourced?",
            "content": "<p>All of our products are made from Organic, Chemical-free, Bleach-free and Chemical-free Flax from France. Our products are manufactured in Europe and sewn locally in the USA. </p><p>We are committed to a ethical and transparent supply chain.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
